    <div>
        <h1><img src="https://meetings.kasb.org/UserUploads/3307/Images/BV_PrimaryLogo_CMYK.jpg" style="font-size:13px; height:145px; width:145px" /><strong><span style="font-size:12px">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong><span style="color:#2980b9"><span style="font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:36px"><strong>BLUE VALLEY BOARD OF EDUCATION&nbsp;</strong></span></span></span></h1>

<hr />
<p><br />
Thank you for your interest in Blue Valley School District. The Blue Valley Board of Education&#39;s monthly business meeting is when the Board&nbsp;publicly conducts its business of governing the school district. This&nbsp;platform is used to host&nbsp;the official business of the Board of Education.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
The Blue Valley School District is proud to offer live-streaming of the Regular Board of Education meetings hosted on the&nbsp;<u><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@bluevalleyboardofeducation3573/streams"><span style="color:#3366ff">Blue</span></a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@bluevalleyboardofeducation3573/streams"><span style="color:#3366ff">&nbsp;Valley Board of Education YouTube channel</span></a></u>&nbsp;beginning&nbsp;at 5:30 p.m.&nbsp;</p>

<p>Click on the links to view <a href="https://policy.kasb.org/kansas/browse/BlueValleyUSD229"><u><span style="color:#3366ff">Board Policies</span></u></a>&nbsp;or <u><a href="https://bluevalleyk12.community.highbond.com/Portal/MeetingTypeList.aspx"><span style="color:#3366ff">past meeting agendas and approved meeting minutes</span></a></u>.<br />
<br />
For more information, please contact the Clerk of the Board, Anna Sweeney, at&nbsp;<u><a href="mailto:amsweeney03@bluevalleyk12.org"><span style="color:#3366ff">amsweeney03@bluevalleyk12.org</span></a></u>.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style="font-size:12px"><span style="font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif"><a href="https://www.bluevalleyk12.org/Page/34287" target="_blank">Meet the Board of Education</a>.</span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:center"><img alt="Board of Education " src="https://meetings.kasb.org/UserUploads/3307/Images/2026 Board of Education Photo.jpg" style="float:left; height:373px; width:560px" />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>
&nbsp;

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><br />
<br />
<br />
&nbsp;</p>

